  {
    "source": "I stand at the end of a cobbled forest path, before me lies a shunned and decrepit old church building. This is the access point to the domains of the abhorred \"Cult of Starry Wisdom\". I am determined to enter these sprawling catacombs and purge them of the corruption that dwells within. Somewhere below lies an artifact of non-human origin referred to as {COLOR_YELLOW}\"The shining Trapezohedron\"{reset_color} - rumored to be a window to all the secrets of the universe. This must be destroyed, so that none more may be tempted by its deceitful promises!",
    "target": "我站在一条铺着鹅卵石的森林小径尽头，面前是一座遭人唾弃、年久失修的古老教堂。这里是可憎的“星辰智慧教团”领地入口。我决心进入这片广阔的地下墓穴，净化其中的腐化。下方某处藏着一件非人造物，名为{COLOR_YELLOW}“闪耀的梯形晶体”{reset_color}——据说它是窥见宇宙一切秘密的窗口。必须摧毁它，免得更多人被它欺骗性的承诺诱惑！",
    "locations": [
      "src/game.cpp:81"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
