  {
    "source": "In addition to this, the top high score entries show up as gravestones on the first level of the game (in the forest). Bumping a gravestone shows a short summary of the high score entry.",
    "target": "除此之外，游戏第一层（森林）中还会出现代表高分榜前列的墓碑。撞上墓碑便可查看该条高分记录的简要总结。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:249"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "In addition to your physical and mental health, you have an \"essence\" - or Spirit - to preserve. If you lose all your Spirit, you are dead.",
    "target": "除了身体与精神健康，你还必须保全自己的“精华”——也就是精神值。精神值耗尽，你就会死亡。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:190"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "In any inventory screen, you can see percentage values to the far right of each item. This is how many percent of your total carried weight that each item takes (the numbers roughly adds up to 100%, but there will be rounding errors, since decimals are not shown). So if you are overburdened, an item with a high percentage value might be a good candidate to drop.",
    "target": "在物品栏界面中，每件物品最右侧都显示一个百分比，表示该物品占你携带总重量的比例（数字大致相加为100%，但由于不显示小数，会有舍入误差）。如果你负重过多，高百分比的物品或许适合丢弃。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:172"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "In his house at R'lyeh dead Cthulhu waits dreaming.",
    "target": "在R’lyeh的居所中，死去的克苏鲁仍在梦中等待。",
